Package: preen
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Preen contributors
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.10), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.10), libqt6widgets6, libqt6qml6, libqt6quick6 (>= 6.10), libqt6quickcontrols2-6, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, pkexec, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: qml6-module-org-kde-desktop
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/youxufkhan/preen
Description: Clean, uninstall, analyze and monitor Linux
 Preen removes caches, logs, old snap versions, old kernels and developer
 caches; uninstalls apt, snap, Flatpak and AppImage apps with their
 leftovers; shows what uses disk space; and reports live system health.
 Every change is shown for review first. Inspired by Mole for macOS.
